    <h1>Reporting That Turns Field Data into Decisions</h1>
    <p>The Assetas reporting module turns the data your teams collect on assets, work orders, inspections, compliance and telemetry into answers you can act on. Each report can be shown the way that reads best: a sortable table, a chart, a pivot table, a Gantt schedule, a calendar, a map, a key-value panel or a single headline number. Viewers narrow the results themselves with filters for date ranges, assets, contacts and selection lists. You can pin reports to dashboards, share chosen reports publicly with an IP allow list, pull them through the REST API, or schedule them to arrive by email as CSV or Excel attachments. Every run is logged, so you can see who is using what and catch failures early. Operations managers, engineers and compliance staff all work from the same live data, with no exports to stitch together and no spreadsheets to rebuild every month.</p>
